1
00:01:08,300 --> 00:01:10,800
"Blue Lips"

2
00:01:11,300 --> 00:01:13,800
(Episode 11)

3
00:01:17,079 --> 00:01:19,059
Someone already paid your hospital bill.

4
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:21,000
What?

5
00:01:35,679 --> 00:01:37,199
Did you pay my sister's hospital bill?

6
00:01:37,880 --> 00:01:38,880
Hospital bill?

7
00:01:39,820 --> 00:01:40,820
I have no idea.

8
00:01:41,300 --> 00:01:42,540
Someone else must have paid it.

9
00:01:42,599 --> 00:01:43,920
Who asked you to butt in?

10
00:01:45,179 --> 00:01:46,559
How is it butting in?

11
00:01:46,880 --> 00:01:48,380
It's a matter of life and death.

12
00:01:48,679 --> 00:01:49,440
In this world,

13
00:01:49,441 --> 00:01:51,075
is there anything more important than life?

14
00:01:51,099 --> 00:01:52,099
You...

15
00:01:52,300 --> 00:01:53,039
Besides,

16
00:01:53,239 --> 00:01:54,940
you have no proof that I paid it.

17
00:01:55,440 --> 00:01:57,760
Maybe some Good Samaritan did a good deed.

18
00:01:59,380 --> 00:01:59,920
Fine.

19
00:02:00,159 --> 00:02:01,159
You wait.

20
00:02:01,639 --> 00:02:02,360
I'll transfer the money to you.
Transferring it won't work.

21
00:02:03,400 --> 00:02:04,500
I won't accept it.

22
00:02:05,019 --> 00:02:06,420
If you give me cash,

23
00:02:06,539 --> 00:02:07,980
I'll just give it to your sister.

24
00:02:10,300 --> 00:02:11,320
You scoundrel!

25
00:02:16,019 --> 00:02:17,500
Don't think I can't deal with you.

26
00:02:31,719 --> 00:02:33,179
You haven't opened this letter?

27
00:02:34,739 --> 00:02:35,739
Why would I?

28
00:02:36,159 --> 00:02:37,340
It's not mine.

29
00:02:38,900 --> 00:02:40,320
So you don't know what this is?

30
00:02:42,059 --> 00:02:43,059
I don't care.

31
00:02:43,440 --> 00:02:45,000
It's probably just useless junk anyway.

32
00:02:46,840 --> 00:02:48,520
Then why did you bring it to the hospital?

33
00:02:49,940 --> 00:02:50,519
I was just...
Shixian.

34
00:02:54,559 --> 00:02:55,559
Leave right now.

35
00:02:55,719 --> 00:02:56,799
Don't let me see you again.

36
00:02:57,119 --> 00:02:58,260
Or I won't play nice.

37
00:03:03,820 --> 00:03:04,820
Sis.

38
00:03:09,199 --> 00:03:10,739
Isn't this the guy from yesterday?

39
00:03:11,079 --> 00:03:12,079
He hasn't left?

40
00:03:12,880 --> 00:03:13,880
He...

41
00:03:14,519 --> 00:03:16,460
He doesn't look like he's here for revenge.

42
00:03:17,260 --> 00:03:18,360
Who exactly is he?

43
00:03:21,119 --> 00:03:22,119
He...

44
00:03:22,900 --> 00:03:23,900
Hello, Miss Wu.

45
00:03:24,340 --> 00:03:25,400
My name is Teng Mo.

46
00:03:25,539 --> 00:03:26,619
I'm a friend of Shixian's.

47
00:03:27,340 --> 00:03:28,900
We met at Blue Moon.

48
00:03:29,019 --> 00:03:29,760
To be exact,

49
00:03:29,840 --> 00:03:31,219
I'm also a fan of his.

50
00:03:31,579 --> 00:03:32,679
My parents are in Fengzhou.

51
00:03:32,940 --> 00:03:34,115
They're getting up there in years.

52
00:03:34,139 --> 00:03:35,356
Although their health isn't the best,

53
00:03:35,380 --> 00:03:36,739
they can take care of themselves.

54
00:03:36,800 --> 00:03:37,519
As for me,
I'm thirty years old.

55
00:03:38,300 --> 00:03:39,019
Still unmarried.

56
00:03:39,079 --> 00:03:40,360
I don't have any bad habits.

57
00:03:40,539 --> 00:03:41,739
And I don't have a girlfriend.

58
00:03:41,900 --> 00:03:42,460
I wonder,

59
00:03:42,619 --> 00:03:44,420
do you have any other questions?

60
00:03:45,239 --> 00:03:46,139
Are you crazy?

61
00:03:46,260 --> 00:03:47,319
Why are you introducing yourself?

62
00:03:47,320 --> 00:03:48,320
Who asked you?

63
00:03:49,219 --> 00:03:51,400
Your sister looks like
she really wants to know.

64
00:03:52,360 --> 00:03:53,539
You're really sick.

65
00:03:53,880 --> 00:03:54,920
You've got serious issues.

66
00:03:58,139 --> 00:03:59,380
Mr. Teng, right?

67
00:04:00,840 --> 00:04:02,500
What do you do for a living?

68
00:04:03,559 --> 00:04:06,579
I run an adult novelty store.

69
00:04:13,900 --> 00:04:16,139
You just said you're thirty?

70
00:04:16,460 --> 00:04:16,800
Yes.

71
00:04:16,880 --> 00:04:18,040
Just turned thirty this year.

72
00:04:18,639 --> 00:04:20,320
So you followed him all the way here

73
00:04:20,480 --> 00:04:22,380
just because you like hearing him sing?

74
00:04:24,039 --> 00:04:25,320
Not just

75
00:04:25,579 --> 00:04:26,899
because I like hearing him sing.

76
00:04:26,900 --> 00:04:27,519
Sis.

77
00:04:27,639 --> 00:04:29,459
You haven't had breakfast yet, have you?

78
00:04:29,460 --> 00:04:30,460
Right?

79
00:04:30,739 --> 00:04:32,019
I haven't finished speaking yet.

80
00:04:32,480 --> 00:04:33,480
Don't interrupt.

81
00:04:36,320 --> 00:04:37,695
How long have you known each other?

82
00:04:37,719 --> 00:04:38,980
Four months and twelve days.

83
00:04:39,199 --> 00:04:40,280
That's not very long.

84
00:04:41,320 --> 00:04:42,320
Shixian.

85
00:04:43,400 --> 00:04:44,400
Come sit over here.

86
00:04:49,519 --> 00:04:50,519
Mr. Teng.

87
00:04:50,619 --> 00:04:51,719
Have you had breakfast?

88
00:04:52,079 --> 00:04:52,699
I have.

89
00:04:52,980 --> 00:04:54,059
We haven't eaten yet.

90
00:04:54,699 --> 00:04:56,019
I bought a variety of things.

91
00:04:56,440 --> 00:04:57,880
I don't know what you'd like to eat.

92
00:04:58,079 --> 00:04:59,179
Just put it down for now.

93
00:04:59,719 --> 00:05:01,359
There's no hot water left in the thermos.

94
00:05:01,559 --> 00:05:02,739
It needs to get filled up.

95
00:05:03,280 --> 00:05:03,840
I'll do it.

96
00:05:04,260 --> 00:05:06,219
The rag on the table needs washing too.

97
00:05:06,719 --> 00:05:07,519
It's about time.

98
00:05:07,579 --> 00:05:08,695
The test results should be out.

99
00:05:08,719 --> 00:05:10,079
They need to be collected as well.

100
00:05:10,380 --> 00:05:11,620
No problem, I'll handle it all.

101
00:05:13,239 --> 00:05:14,239
What are you doing?

102
00:05:14,659 --> 00:05:15,280
Sis.

103
00:05:15,519 --> 00:05:16,900
These are my chores.

104
00:05:17,119 --> 00:05:18,199
Why let him do it?

105
00:05:18,480 --> 00:05:19,820
He volunteered.

106
00:05:20,780 --> 00:05:21,780
Right?

107
00:05:21,920 --> 00:05:22,920
Of course.

108
00:05:23,219 --> 00:05:23,739
You see,

109
00:05:23,840 --> 00:05:25,560
two people taking turns is better than one.

110
00:05:25,719 --> 00:05:27,158
Look at you, staying up so long.

111
00:05:27,159 --> 00:05:27,860
You have dark circles under your eyes.

112
00:05:28,059 --> 00:05:29,059
I'll go.

113
00:05:31,340 --> 00:05:32,340
Whatever.

114
00:05:40,360 --> 00:05:41,360
Head Nurse.

115
00:05:42,059 --> 00:05:43,139
My friend came to visit me.

116
00:05:43,260 --> 00:05:44,679
He ordered some food and drinks.

117
00:05:44,880 --> 00:05:45,400
This is for you.

118
00:05:45,780 --> 00:05:47,159
Mr. Teng, you're too kind.

119
00:05:47,820 --> 00:05:49,300
We're well acquainted now, after all.

120
00:05:51,179 --> 00:05:52,179
So, Head Nurse,

121
00:05:52,519 --> 00:05:56,380
are there any single rooms in the
cardiovascular department available?

122
00:05:56,380 --> 00:05:57,380
Could one be freed up?

123
00:05:58,239 --> 00:05:59,555
There are too many patients lately.

124
00:05:59,579 --> 00:06:00,999
A single room just opened up this morning,

125
00:06:01,000 --> 00:06:02,256
and someone is moving in this afternoon.

126
00:06:02,280 --> 00:06:03,476
There really aren't enough beds.

127
00:06:03,500 --> 00:06:04,179
There's just no space.
I understand.

128
00:06:05,039 --> 00:06:06,039
But you have to know,

129
00:06:06,280 --> 00:06:08,300
the girl in bed 107,

130
00:06:08,820 --> 00:06:09,920
she's quite seriously ill.

131
00:06:10,119 --> 00:06:11,699
For a young woman,

132
00:06:12,280 --> 00:06:12,760
well,

133
00:06:12,920 --> 00:06:15,236
having so many people coming
and going isn't very convenient.

134
00:06:15,266 --> 00:06:17,106
We can cover whatever
the price difference is.

135
00:06:17,260 --> 00:06:18,519
I'll have to see how things go.

136
00:06:18,619 --> 00:06:20,535
It's not something I can
just arrange on the spot.

137
00:06:20,559 --> 00:06:20,980
How about this?
I'll keep an eye out for you.

138
00:06:21,980 --> 00:06:22,980
Keep it quiet for now.

139
00:06:23,199 --> 00:06:23,619
Understood.

140
00:06:23,840 --> 00:06:24,840
Thank you, Head Nurse.

141
00:06:28,480 --> 00:06:29,480
What is it?

142
00:06:32,699 --> 00:06:33,699
Are you mad?

143
00:06:35,980 --> 00:06:36,980
Don't follow me.

144
00:06:37,480 --> 00:06:38,480
If others see us,

145
00:06:39,059 --> 00:06:40,739
they'll wonder what's going on between us.

146
00:06:40,860 --> 00:06:41,900
I didn't even do anything.

147
00:06:42,320 --> 00:06:43,856
What's wrong with chatting
with my little brother?

148
00:06:43,880 --> 00:06:44,920
Who's your little brother?

149
00:06:47,480 --> 00:06:48,840
Why are you so mad?

150
00:06:52,219 --> 00:06:52,659
What?

151
00:06:52,920 --> 00:06:54,080
Your sister bossing me around

152
00:06:54,760 --> 00:06:55,760
makes you feel bad?

153
00:06:56,260 --> 00:06:57,260
Stop talking nonsense.

154
00:07:00,199 --> 00:07:01,199
This is for you.

155
00:07:01,300 --> 00:07:02,300
What's yours is yours.

156
00:07:02,420 --> 00:07:03,420
Why won't you take it?

157
00:07:03,639 --> 00:07:04,816
You should open it and take a look.

158
00:07:04,840 --> 00:07:06,079
See what's written inside.

159
00:07:06,179 --> 00:07:07,179
Then you'll understand.

160
00:07:07,619 --> 00:07:08,619
Look at what?

161
00:07:09,940 --> 00:07:10,940
You have a mouth.

162
00:07:11,519 --> 00:07:12,719
Why not just tell me directly?

163
00:07:14,079 --> 00:07:15,799
I'm the one who wronged you in this matter.

164
00:07:16,360 --> 00:07:17,340
But there's no need for you to

165
00:07:17,341 --> 00:07:19,219
suffer just to spite me.

166
00:07:19,840 --> 00:07:21,178
Besides, every time I try to help you,

167
00:07:21,179 --> 00:07:21,780
you refuse.

168
00:07:21,860 --> 00:07:23,715
You insist on gritting your
teeth and toughing it out alone.

169
00:07:23,739 --> 00:07:24,739
Bothering me just once,

170
00:07:26,059 --> 00:07:27,119
what's the big deal?

171
00:07:28,260 --> 00:07:29,580
What does it have to do with you?

172
00:07:29,960 --> 00:07:31,260
Why should I accept your favors?

173
00:07:40,860 --> 00:07:41,860
Shixian.

174
00:07:42,860 --> 00:07:44,340
You should go home and sleep tonight.

175
00:07:44,840 --> 00:07:46,240
There's nothing much going on here.

176
00:07:46,420 --> 00:07:47,420
I'm fine, Sis.

177
00:07:50,820 --> 00:07:51,280
Come on.

178
00:07:51,679 --> 00:07:52,679
I'll cover for you.

179
00:07:53,360 --> 00:07:54,840
What do you mean you'll cover for me?

180
00:07:55,820 --> 00:07:56,936
Sis, really, there's no need.

181
00:07:56,960 --> 00:07:58,080
You just get some good rest.

182
00:08:04,480 --> 00:08:05,480
Go home.

183
00:08:06,139 --> 00:08:07,139
Be good.

184
00:08:16,359 --> 00:08:17,359
It's all set.

185
00:08:23,439 --> 00:08:24,699
The room has been reserved.

186
00:08:26,039 --> 00:08:27,319
Someone else's bed opened up.

187
00:08:27,539 --> 00:08:28,539
We're moving over there.

188
00:08:29,079 --> 00:08:30,079
Aren't those

189
00:08:30,239 --> 00:08:31,239
really hard to get?

190
00:08:31,420 --> 00:08:33,220
The Head Nurse
specifically saved it for us.

191
00:08:34,520 --> 00:08:35,880
Wouldn't that be really expensive?

192
00:08:36,600 --> 00:08:38,000
If there's a room, why not take it?

193
00:08:38,140 --> 00:08:39,140
Right?

194
00:08:39,539 --> 00:08:40,539
Sis.

195
00:08:40,760 --> 00:08:41,340
How about

196
00:08:41,699 --> 00:08:42,720
we head over there first?

197
00:08:42,899 --> 00:08:43,380
That way,

198
00:08:43,520 --> 00:08:44,800
we can all get some better rest.

199
00:08:49,340 --> 00:08:50,039
You guys go ahead.

200
00:08:50,159 --> 00:08:51,159
I'll clean this up.

201
00:08:53,539 --> 00:08:54,539
Thank you.

202
00:09:03,439 --> 00:09:04,439
Excuse me, nurse.

203
00:09:05,060 --> 00:09:06,419
Why were we suddenly

204
00:09:06,420 --> 00:09:08,079
moved to a private room?

205
00:09:08,859 --> 00:09:10,180
Well, I'm not sure either.

206
00:09:10,859 --> 00:09:12,379
Then what about the cost of this room?

207
00:09:13,020 --> 00:09:14,238
Mr. Teng has already paid in advance

208
00:09:14,239 --> 00:09:15,500
for two weeks.

209
00:09:16,399 --> 00:09:17,399
Mr. Teng...

210
00:09:18,979 --> 00:09:19,979
Thank you.

211
00:09:35,340 --> 00:09:36,340
Mr. Teng,

212
00:09:36,939 --> 00:09:38,699
thank you for everything
you've done for us.

213
00:09:40,380 --> 00:09:43,279
Actually, the head
nurse was just being kind.

214
00:09:43,439 --> 00:09:45,300
She saw it was tough for you on your own,

215
00:09:45,539 --> 00:09:46,600
so she made the switch.

216
00:09:47,720 --> 00:09:48,720
Mr. Teng,

217
00:09:48,760 --> 00:09:49,760
please have a seat.

218
00:09:52,560 --> 00:09:53,560
Miss Wu,

219
00:09:53,819 --> 00:09:55,760
just call me Teng Mo.

220
00:09:57,460 --> 00:09:58,079
Okay.

221
00:09:58,460 --> 00:09:59,460
Teng Mo,

222
00:09:59,600 --> 00:10:01,039
I'll get straight to the point.

223
00:10:02,460 --> 00:10:04,340
Even though Shixian didn't say anything,

224
00:10:05,039 --> 00:10:06,519
I know you two have

225
00:10:06,520 --> 00:10:08,560
a deeper relationship than I imagined.

226
00:10:10,279 --> 00:10:12,300
Shixian is a pure-hearted kid.

227
00:10:13,060 --> 00:10:14,739
If it weren't for my illness,

228
00:10:15,199 --> 00:10:17,619
his life wouldn't have been so rough.

229
00:10:19,020 --> 00:10:20,000
So when you said

230
00:10:20,001 --> 00:10:21,880
you met him at Blue Moon,

231
00:10:22,579 --> 00:10:23,819
I was both sad

232
00:10:24,000 --> 00:10:25,000
and relieved.

233
00:10:29,359 --> 00:10:30,359
Take it easy.

234
00:10:31,180 --> 00:10:32,180
Thank you.

235
00:10:34,960 --> 00:10:36,359
You're a reliable person,

236
00:10:36,960 --> 00:10:38,159
and very smart.

237
00:10:39,359 --> 00:10:40,779
Ever since you showed up,

238
00:10:41,399 --> 00:10:43,060
not only did we get a private room,

239
00:10:43,460 --> 00:10:45,660
but we also don't have to
wait in long lines for tests.

240
00:10:45,880 --> 00:10:48,479
Even the doctors and nurses
are treating us much better.

241
00:10:49,779 --> 00:10:51,039
So I'm guessing

242
00:10:52,239 --> 00:10:54,359
when Shixian was at Blue Moon,

243
00:10:54,659 --> 00:10:56,460
you took good care of him too.

244
00:10:57,140 --> 00:10:58,680
I truly appreciate it.

245
00:10:59,859 --> 00:11:00,859
Don't mention it.

246
00:11:01,100 --> 00:11:01,720
Well,

247
00:11:01,920 --> 00:11:03,619
I wouldn't call it taking care of him.

248
00:11:06,220 --> 00:11:08,619
But Shixian is still young, after all.

249
00:11:08,819 --> 00:11:10,279
He's ten years younger than you.

250
00:11:10,479 --> 00:11:12,619
He doesn't have much life experience.

251
00:11:13,680 --> 00:11:15,858
The ways of the world,

252
00:11:15,859 --> 00:11:16,960
and all its complexities,

253
00:11:17,760 --> 00:11:19,120
he doesn't really understand them.

254
00:11:21,920 --> 00:11:23,419
But he has his own way

255
00:11:23,420 --> 00:11:25,140
of expressing his feelings.

256
00:11:26,479 --> 00:11:28,180
That's what makes him so endearing.

257
00:11:29,119 --> 00:11:32,239
So I hope you won't take
advantage of his kindness

258
00:11:32,380 --> 00:11:33,560
to manipulate him.

259
00:11:36,140 --> 00:11:38,039
Please forgive me, as an older sister,

260
00:11:38,399 --> 00:11:40,118
for wanting to protect my family

261
00:11:40,119 --> 00:11:41,619
and being a bit cynical.

262
00:11:55,300 --> 00:11:57,800
I assume you gave him this necklace too.

263
00:11:59,659 --> 00:12:01,020
However much this room costs,

264
00:12:01,399 --> 00:12:02,399
I'll pay you back.

265
00:12:03,159 --> 00:12:04,159
Miss Wu,

266
00:12:04,619 --> 00:12:05,140
really,

267
00:12:05,520 --> 00:12:07,060
I don't think that's necessary.

268
00:12:07,279 --> 00:12:08,279
You're overthinking it.

269
00:12:08,699 --> 00:12:09,920
The reason I'm helping Shixian

270
00:12:10,079 --> 00:12:12,319
is because he once did me a huge favor.

271
00:12:12,880 --> 00:12:14,720
Consider this me returning the favor.

272
00:12:15,180 --> 00:12:15,779
Besides,

273
00:12:16,199 --> 00:12:17,659
you guys genuinely need help.

274
00:12:17,880 --> 00:12:20,420
I'm just covering the expenses for now.

275
00:12:20,800 --> 00:12:22,579
Shixian will pay me back later.

276
00:12:23,619 --> 00:12:24,680
As for the necklace,

277
00:12:25,060 --> 00:12:26,760
he really did get it for you.

278
00:12:27,800 --> 00:12:29,199
It's a token of his affection.

279
00:12:33,420 --> 00:12:34,420
Rest assured,

280
00:12:34,520 --> 00:12:35,520
I don't have any

281
00:12:36,020 --> 00:12:37,739
ulterior motives when it comes to Shixian.

282
00:12:38,399 --> 00:12:40,619
I simply want to share his burden.

283
00:12:49,920 --> 00:12:51,920
You know, she might look weak now,

284
00:12:52,380 --> 00:12:53,720
but she used to be so lively.

285
00:12:54,380 --> 00:12:56,300
She was the class president growing up.

286
00:12:57,220 --> 00:12:58,220
She had great grades

287
00:12:59,159 --> 00:13:00,300
and loved making friends.

288
00:13:01,560 --> 00:13:03,479
All the boys were
terrified of her back then.

289
00:13:04,880 --> 00:13:05,579
So,

290
00:13:05,739 --> 00:13:07,358
whenever they picked on me,

291
00:13:07,359 --> 00:13:08,859
my sister always stood up for me.

292
00:13:12,380 --> 00:13:13,380
Honestly,

293
00:13:14,720 --> 00:13:16,979
she deserved a much happier life.

294
00:13:22,220 --> 00:13:24,279
So you bought Vandacon for her.

295
00:13:30,420 --> 00:13:31,500
Splitting one pill

296
00:13:32,420 --> 00:13:33,720
to take twice.

297
00:13:35,739 --> 00:13:37,220
Why didn't you tell me sooner?

298
00:13:37,979 --> 00:13:39,439
What good would that have done?

299
00:13:40,920 --> 00:13:42,160
Would it have changed anything?

300
00:13:45,159 --> 00:13:46,159
Besides,

301
00:13:47,800 --> 00:13:48,560
my sister didn't want

302
00:13:48,659 --> 00:13:50,460
anyone to know about her condition.

303
00:13:51,920 --> 00:13:52,920
And neither did I.

304
00:13:59,380 --> 00:14:00,580
After our parents passed away,

305
00:14:01,359 --> 00:14:02,640
she was just a young girl,

306
00:14:03,479 --> 00:14:04,800
playing both father and mother.

307
00:14:06,319 --> 00:14:07,439
She took care of me

308
00:14:08,479 --> 00:14:09,579
and paid for my education.

309
00:14:11,359 --> 00:14:12,180
Only she knows

310
00:14:12,181 --> 00:14:13,640
how much she suffered.

311
00:14:15,779 --> 00:14:17,420
But I've never seen her cry.

312
00:14:19,859 --> 00:14:22,319
After her diagnosis, she hid
it from me and kept working

313
00:14:23,920 --> 00:14:25,779
just so no one would find out,

314
00:14:26,800 --> 00:14:28,680
and so the company wouldn't fire her.

315
00:14:29,699 --> 00:14:32,099
She didn't want her illness to
get in the way of my studies.

316
00:14:33,720 --> 00:14:36,140
I was the one who chose to drop out.

317
00:14:37,720 --> 00:14:39,100
So you went to college?

318
00:14:42,699 --> 00:14:43,880
For about a year.

319
00:14:45,600 --> 00:14:46,659
Which school?

320
00:14:47,439 --> 00:14:48,719
Jinyang Institute of Technology.

321
00:14:49,899 --> 00:14:51,420
Why aren't you going now?

322
00:14:52,619 --> 00:14:53,819
I have to make money.

323
00:14:55,260 --> 00:14:56,140
I need to earn enough in the next two years

324
00:14:56,141 --> 00:14:58,439
to cover all her surgery costs.

325
00:15:00,880 --> 00:15:01,880
The doctor

326
00:15:02,300 --> 00:15:04,239
said her illness can't be cured.

327
00:15:05,840 --> 00:15:07,100
Surgery is the only option.

328
00:15:07,760 --> 00:15:08,880
Besides a lung transplant,

329
00:15:09,060 --> 00:15:10,619
she also needs a heart transplant.

330
00:15:12,119 --> 00:15:12,819
But

331
00:15:13,100 --> 00:15:14,260
we haven't found a match.

332
00:15:15,020 --> 00:15:16,239
And now she's showing

333
00:15:16,520 --> 00:15:17,739
symptoms of heart failure.

334
00:15:18,680 --> 00:15:20,560
She might not even be
able to have the surgery.

335
00:15:24,239 --> 00:15:25,239
Don't worry.

336
00:15:25,920 --> 00:15:27,100
Everything will be fine.

337
00:15:30,979 --> 00:15:32,439
Honestly, for me,

338
00:15:33,039 --> 00:15:35,000
dropping out is just hitting pause.

339
00:15:36,979 --> 00:15:38,640
But if my sister is really gone,

340
00:15:41,239 --> 00:15:42,619
it's truly over.

341
00:15:48,600 --> 00:15:49,960
Sometimes I even wish...

342
00:15:52,840 --> 00:15:54,699
I was the one who got sick.

343
00:15:55,840 --> 00:15:57,039
Don't say that.

344
00:15:59,659 --> 00:16:01,220
We both need to stay healthy.

345
00:16:02,140 --> 00:16:03,140
Okay?

346
00:16:19,020 --> 00:16:19,460
Sis,

347
00:16:19,640 --> 00:16:21,160
I'm going downstairs to buy something.

348
00:16:22,180 --> 00:16:22,840
I'll go.

349
00:16:23,140 --> 00:16:24,140
What if the doctor comes?

350
00:16:24,460 --> 00:16:25,460
It's fine.

351
00:16:25,840 --> 00:16:26,840
I'll go.

352
00:16:26,979 --> 00:16:27,979
I'll be right back.

353
00:16:41,699 --> 00:16:42,699
You little punk,

354
00:16:43,180 --> 00:16:44,760
I finally caught you!

355
00:16:45,020 --> 00:16:46,460
So this is where you've been hiding!

356
00:16:47,439 --> 00:16:48,500
Are you okay?

357
00:16:48,899 --> 00:16:49,899
Let go!

358
00:16:50,279 --> 00:16:51,279
Let go of me!

359
00:16:55,479 --> 00:16:56,479
Run!

360
00:16:56,600 --> 00:16:57,600
Run!

361
00:16:58,140 --> 00:16:59,539
You guys are clearly extorting me!

362
00:16:59,699 --> 00:17:01,139
What the hell are you talking about?

363
00:17:01,246 --> 00:17:02,313
What the fuck!

364
00:17:05,420 --> 00:17:07,119
Why isn't Shixian back yet?

365
00:17:07,420 --> 00:17:08,420
That kid.

366
00:17:09,220 --> 00:17:10,560
I told him to buy a phone,

367
00:17:11,140 --> 00:17:12,780
but I can never reach him once he leaves.

368
00:17:14,000 --> 00:17:15,080
What happened to his phone?

369
00:17:15,439 --> 00:17:16,899
He smashed it.

370
00:17:17,260 --> 00:17:19,119
It rings, but he can't answer it.

371
00:17:20,319 --> 00:17:21,479
When did that happen?

372
00:17:22,859 --> 00:17:24,159
Over a month ago.

373
00:17:25,460 --> 00:17:28,140
He fell into a flowerbed
while making a delivery.

374
00:17:28,399 --> 00:17:30,159
He got a huge gash on his hand,

375
00:17:30,279 --> 00:17:31,579
and his phone broke too.

376
00:17:32,479 --> 00:17:33,800
I told him to buy a new one,

377
00:17:33,899 --> 00:17:35,179
but he wouldn't spend the money.

378
00:17:35,479 --> 00:17:36,199
I told him to replace the screen,
but he refused.

379
00:17:38,399 --> 00:17:39,399
That kid.

380
00:17:40,319 --> 00:17:41,319
I'll go look for him.

381
00:17:41,539 --> 00:17:43,019
Press this bell if you need anything.

382
00:17:50,399 --> 00:17:51,520
Everyone, look at this!

383
00:17:51,739 --> 00:17:53,899
This guy is a deadbeat!

384
00:17:54,699 --> 00:17:55,979
He hit someone and tried to run!

385
00:17:57,779 --> 00:17:59,219
You guys are clearly running a scam!

386
00:17:59,319 --> 00:18:00,000
What the hell are you talking about?

387
00:18:00,001 --> 00:18:02,121
With hair like that, he
doesn't look like a good guy.

388
00:18:02,920 --> 00:18:03,560
What are you doing?

389
00:18:03,899 --> 00:18:04,996
Keep your hands to yourself!

390
00:18:05,020 --> 00:18:06,020
Let's talk this out.

391
00:18:06,359 --> 00:18:07,359
Who the hell are you?

392
00:18:07,659 --> 00:18:08,659
Who are you?

393
00:18:09,239 --> 00:18:10,699
If you're sick, go see a doctor!

394
00:18:12,159 --> 00:18:13,159
Are you okay?

395
00:18:13,680 --> 00:18:14,680
I'm warning you,

396
00:18:15,100 --> 00:18:16,939
this has nothing to do with you.

397
00:18:17,380 --> 00:18:18,500
Mind your own business.

398
00:18:18,819 --> 00:18:19,819
You hear me?

399
00:18:20,100 --> 00:18:21,619
Don't do things the hard way.

400
00:18:21,739 --> 00:18:22,840
If you don't get lost,

401
00:18:23,060 --> 00:18:24,359
I'll beat you up too.

402
00:18:24,640 --> 00:18:25,720
You just want money, right?

403
00:18:25,859 --> 00:18:26,859
I'll pay you.

404
00:18:27,000 --> 00:18:28,039
Why should you pay them?

405
00:18:28,399 --> 00:18:29,719
I didn't even touch that old lady!

406
00:18:29,720 --> 00:18:30,479
Don't give them anything!

407
00:18:30,739 --> 00:18:31,739
Shixian,

408
00:18:31,779 --> 00:18:32,779
let me handle this.

409
00:18:34,060 --> 00:18:35,079
Spit it out. How much?

410
00:18:37,539 --> 00:18:38,539
Not much.

411
00:18:39,500 --> 00:18:40,500
My mom,

412
00:18:40,800 --> 00:18:41,819
she's in her seventies.

413
00:18:42,140 --> 00:18:43,140
Last time,

414
00:18:43,359 --> 00:18:45,260
he hit her and left her half-paralyzed.

415
00:18:46,340 --> 00:18:48,060
Adding everything up,

416
00:18:49,779 --> 00:18:51,340
you need to cough up 300,000.

417
00:18:52,000 --> 00:18:53,000
300,000?

418
00:18:53,460 --> 00:18:54,479
We didn't hit her.

419
00:18:54,840 --> 00:18:56,520
We're only offering this out of goodwill.

420
00:18:56,979 --> 00:18:57,999
Even if we did hit her,

421
00:18:58,000 --> 00:18:59,560
the compensation wouldn't be that high.

422
00:18:59,859 --> 00:19:01,658
Medical expenses are calculated based on

423
00:19:01,659 --> 00:19:03,519
the necessary treatment for the injuries

424
00:19:03,520 --> 00:19:04,555
sustained in the traffic accident.

425
00:19:04,579 --> 00:19:05,699
Paid upon proof of receipts.

426
00:19:05,760 --> 00:19:08,000
Treatment for her underlying
conditions is not included.

427
00:19:08,199 --> 00:19:09,415
Nutritional allowance is 20 a day.

428
00:19:09,439 --> 00:19:10,279
Lost wages are 90.

429
00:19:10,340 --> 00:19:11,340
Nursing care is 60.

430
00:19:11,760 --> 00:19:13,135
If you want to settle this privately,

431
00:19:13,159 --> 00:19:14,840
give me a lump-sum figure.

432
00:19:15,180 --> 00:19:16,856
If you want to go by
the book, that's fine too.

433
00:19:16,880 --> 00:19:18,160
Tell me which hospital she's in.

434
00:19:18,260 --> 00:19:19,639
I'll get the most authoritative judges,

435
00:19:19,640 --> 00:19:21,200
lawyers, and traffic cops to assess it.

436
00:19:21,380 --> 00:19:22,900
To see exactly how much we should pay.

437
00:19:25,159 --> 00:19:26,159
Alright, alright.

438
00:19:26,619 --> 00:19:27,619
You tell me.

439
00:19:27,779 --> 00:19:28,779
How much?

440
00:19:29,720 --> 00:19:30,720
100,000.

441
00:19:31,340 --> 00:19:32,340
No way.
